# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (scripts/check.sh tsan). Each one says why it is not ours or not real.

# metal-cpp's addCompletedHandler(std::function) copies the block on the encoding thread; Metal runs it on a GCD
# thread after the GPU finishes, ordered by Metal internals TSan cannot see. A false positive.
race:MTL::CommandBuffer::addCompletedHandler

# Syphon (third party): two command buffers' completion handlers can run -[SyphonServerBase publish] at once and race
# on its _pushPending flag; at worst the surface ID is sent to clients twice.
race:SyphonServerBase
